Manchester Funerals — holding page
==================================

This repository holds material under three different sets of terms. Find the
files you want below; there is no single licence covering the whole thing.


1. THE PHOTOGRAPH — CC BY-SA 2.0
--------------------------------

    assets/img/moor-2560.webp
    assets/img/moor-3200.webp
    assets/img/moor-4096.webp
    assets/img/moor-portrait-1536.webp

Adapted from "Saddleworth Moor" by Roger Cornfoot
<https://www.geograph.org.uk/photo/5485216>, licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.0 Generic licence
<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/>.

Changes made: upscaled 4x, cropped to 16:9 and to 3:4, desaturated to 60%
saturation, re-encoded as WebP at three widths plus a portrait variant.

These adaptations are distributed under that same licence, as ShareAlike
requires. You may reuse them under CC BY-SA 2.0, keeping the attribution above
and licensing anything you make from them the same way.


